    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A small <strong>slice of life exploration </strong>game where you explore floating islands on The Albatross, a one person plane of your own design. Talk to the townsfolk, find secrets, and grapple with your creative struggles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fly around at your own pace and discover secrets about the islands.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet an assortment of townsfolk with their own struggles and help them with small tasks.</p></li></ul>",
